1
00:00:01,251 --> 00:00:02,950
As Uke grabs and strikes

2
00:00:02,951 --> 00:00:03,788
slide in

3
00:00:04,089 --> 00:00:05,449
controlling the strike

4
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:08,692
bring Uke around in a big circular movement 
in front of you

5
00:00:08,693 --> 00:00:10,747
Raise the arm back up
as he comes round

6
00:00:11,048 --> 00:00:14,041
step in deeply behind 
controlling the back of the neck,

7
00:00:14,042 --> 00:00:15,491
cut down towards the mat

8
00:00:16,092 --> 00:00:18,301
As Uke comes up to regain his balance

9
00:00:18,302 --> 00:00:19,639
draw him into your shoulder

10
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:22,280
step in deeply behind and throw down.

